'''Summon Bestial Ursa''' is a [[spell]] that summons an allied [[Ursa]] [[minion]]. The skill is solely available through {{il|page=Yriel's Fostering (Ursa)}}. 

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
The summoned Bestial Ursa uses a [[Ground Slam]] attack and a [[Skill:DropBearSummonedRallyingCry|Rallying Cry]] skill that grants 25% increased damage and 14.8 mana regeneration per second for 4 seconds, with a 5 second cooldown. Like the other [[bestial minion]]s, the Bestial Ursa's hits cannot be evaded.

==Acquisition==
Summon Bestial Ursa can only be obtained by equipping {{il|page=Yriel's Fostering (Ursa)}}.

